{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724; --glass:#ffffff11; --card:#ffffff10; --accent:#6ee7b7; --muted:#cbd5e1; --glass-2:#ffffff06;
      --maxw:1100px; --radius:16px; --glass-blur:8px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071226 0%, #08121a 40%), url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:cover;color:#e6eef6}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:24px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#60a5fa);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#042028;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:#fff}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(var(--glass-blur));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.2px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,button,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#e6eef6}
    input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#9fb0c2}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row input{flex:1}
    button.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#60a5fa);border:0;color:#042028;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
    .test-text{font-size:15px;color:#dbeefe}
    .test-author{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);cursor:default;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px}
    .badge[data-tooltip]:hover:after{content:attr(data-tooltip);position:absolute;bottom:120%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;background:#021022;color:#e6eef6;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}

    /* Accordion */
    .accordion{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .acc-item{border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
    .acc-summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px;background:var(--glass-2);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .acc-content{padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--glass-2));color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .crisis{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a1b1b22,transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,0.06);color:#ffd6d6}

    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{width:44px;height:44px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">T</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted">Private practice • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="about.html">Therapist</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html">Plan a Session</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:#fff">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Reach out to start a thoughtful clinical conversation</h1>
          <p class="lead">I offer focused planning sessions and ongoing therapy. If you're ready to explore next steps, use this page to connect. Phone and email shown below are the direct routes for scheduling or quick questions.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <div class="muted">or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:18px">
            <div class="panel" style="padding:12px">
              <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">Proof Gallery</div>
              <div class="proof">
                <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial" aria-live="polite">
                  <div class="test-text">"I left our first focused session with a clear, practical plan that felt true to my life. The pace was exactly what I needed."</div>
                  <div class="test-author">— Client, mid-career</div>
                </div>

                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
                  <div class="badges" id="badges">
                    <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Licensed clinician with 10+ years of practice"> 
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.6"/></svg>
                      <span class="muted">Licensed</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Approved for telehealth across state lines where licensed">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.6"/></svg>
                      <span class="muted">Telehealth</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Member of a recognized professional association">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 5l3 6-3 2-3-2 3-6z" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.6"/></svg>
                      <span class="muted">Assoc.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                    <button id="prev" aria-label="Previous testimonial" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted)">◀</button>
                    <button id="next" aria-label="Next testimonial" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted)">▶</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel">
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Get in touch</div>
          <form id="contactForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post">
            <input name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required />
            <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email — {{EMAIL}}" required />
            <input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Phone — optional" />
            <select name="reason" aria-label="Reason">
              <option>Initial planning session (VIP Day)</option>
              <option>Ongoing weekly sessions</option>
              <option>Consult / limited-series</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Brief note about what brings you here (goals, timeline, scheduling needs)"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">I aim to respond within 48 hours on business days.</div>
              <button class="cta" type="submit">Request a Conversation</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">
            Phone: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong><br>
            Email: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>
          </div>

        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" style="margin-bottom:12px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Session boundaries & confidentiality</div>
        <div class="accordion" id="accordion">
          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-summary" data-acc="0" tabindex="0">Session structure <span class="muted">— what to expect</span></div>
            <div class="acc-content" data-content="0">
              Typical appointments last 45–60 minutes. We will set a mutually agreed cadence for ongoing work. If you need more time occasionally, we can discuss options in advance.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-summary" data-acc="1" tabindex="0">Confidentiality & limits <span class="muted">— privacy and scope</span></div>
            <div class="acc-content" data-content="1">
              Conversations are confidential and kept in secure records. Exceptions include imminent risk of harm to self or others, suspected abuse of a minor or vulnerable adult, or court-ordered disclosure. I will always discuss limits of confidentiality with you and include this in the intake paperwork.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-summary" data-acc="2" tabindex="0">Cancellation & fees <span class="muted">— brief policy</span></div>
            <div class="acc-content" data-content="2">
              I ask for at least 48 hours' notice to avoid a cancellation fee. Insurance coverage varies; I can provide receipts for reimbursement where appropriate. Fees and payment options are reviewed before starting work.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-summary" data-acc="3" tabindex="0">Telehealth & technical notes <span class="muted">— video sessions</span></div>
            <div class="acc-content" data-content="3">
              Video sessions are offered; we will confirm platform and privacy practices. If a session cannot be completed due to technology, we will reschedule or switch to phone when appropriate.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crisis" role="note">
          <strong>Crisis & safety:</strong> If you are in immediate danger or need urgent medical help, please call emergency services or your local crisis number. If you are within the United States, the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline is available at 988. If you are outside the U.S., contact local emergency services or reach out to a trusted local resource. I cannot provide emergency services via email.
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
            <div class="muted">Private practice — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            <div class="muted">Phone: {{PHONE}} • Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>

          <div class="muted">This site is informational. Contact does not create a therapeutic relationship until we have agreed on terms and signed intake documents.</div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Proof gallery rotation
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {text: 'I left our first focused session with a clear, practical plan that fit my week.', author: 'Client, 30s'},
        {text: 'The clinician helped me prioritize without minimizing how it felt—steady and experienced.', author: 'Client, 40s'},
        {text: 'Telehealth sessions were smooth and we built a usable plan quickly.', author: 'Client, remote'}
      ];
      const el = document.getElementById('testimonial');
      let idx = 0;
      function render(i){
        el.innerHTML = '<div class="test-text">"'+testimonials[i].text+'"</div><div class="test-author">— '+testimonials[i].author+'</div>';
      }
      render(0);
      let timer = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(idx); }, 6000);
      document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearInterval(timer); idx = (idx-1+testimonials.length)%testimonials.length; render(idx); timer = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(idx); },6000); });
      document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{ clearInterval(timer); idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(idx); timer = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; render(idx); },6000); });
    })();

    // Accessible accordion simple behavior
    (function(){
      const summaries = document.querySelectorAll('.acc-summary');
      summaries.forEach(sum=>{
        sum.addEventListener('click', toggle);
        sum.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==="Enter"||e.key===' ') { e.preventDefault(); toggle.call(sum); } });
      });
      function toggle(){
        const id = this.getAttribute('data-acc');
        const content = document.querySelector('[data-content="'+id+'"]');
        const open = content.style.display === 'block';
        // close all
        document.querySelectorAll('.acc-content').forEach(c=>c.style.display='none');
        if(!open){ content.style.display='block'; }
      }
      // collapse all initially
      document.querySelectorAll('.acc-content').forEach(c=>c.style.display='none');
    })();

    // Simple form UX: show a tiny confirmation without sending data from this static template
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        // Prevent actual submit in this static template
        e.preventDefault();
        const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=submit]');
        btn.textContent = 'Request sent';
        btn.disabled = true;
        setTimeout(()=>{ btn.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}'; btn.disabled = false; form.reset(); }, 2200);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}  
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact page and notes

This bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for the private practice therapist site and a short README.

Files included:
- contact.html: A self-contained contact & information page that implements:
  - A glass-morphism visual style using local CSS only.
  - Navigation linking to all pages in the site.
  - A contact form (static) that demonstrates the primary call-to-action using the placeholders {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.
  - A Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials with credibility badges that show tooltips on hover.
  - An accessible accordion for session boundaries, confidentiality, cancellation, and telehealth notes.
  - A respectful crisis footer with clear guidance and limits of email contact.
  - Placeholders to be replaced for business-specific values: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Notes for integrators:
- This is a static template. The contact form prevents a real submit so it can be used safely in development. Replace the form action and remove the preventing script for a real backend integration.
- The proof gallery rotation and accordion are implemented in small, dependency-free JavaScript blocks.
- The page references an SVG background at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure that asset is supplied in the assets folder for consistent background visuals.

Clinical & copy notes:
- The content avoids medical claims and guarantees, keeps language supportive and clinician-grounded, and includes confidentiality and limits information as required.
- Do not use manipulative scarcity language; this template uses steady, clear invitation phrasing.

How to preview:
- Drop these files into a local static server root alongside the rest of the site pages and the assets folder, then open contact.html in a browser."}
BUNDLE_END
